{"seq":1,"slug":"contributions-to-mathematics","title":"对数学的贡献","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/a-universal-genius/contributions-to-mathematics","wordCount":1726,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"对数学的贡献\">对数学的贡献</h1><p>在成为计算机与博弈论的奠基者之前，冯·诺依曼首先是一位纯粹数学家，而且是 20 世纪最多产、涉猎最广的之一。他在数学基础、算子理论、遍历理论、测度论、几何学等领域都留下了以他命名的成果。本篇梳理他<strong>纯数学</strong>领域的几项具体贡献——它们是什么、解决了什么、为何重要；他在物理学（量子力学）与生物学（元胞自动机）等领域的跨界工作，见姊妹篇<a href=\"quantum-mechanics-and-beyond\">《量子力学及其他》</a>，不在此重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>冯·诺依曼的纯数学贡献分布于四个方向，它们共享一种方法论：<strong>把模糊的直觉翻译成精确的集合—算子语言</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>标志性成果</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数学基础</td>\n<td>序数的现代定义、NBG 集合论</td>\n<td>让序数成为可用集合操作的对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算子理论</td>\n<td>冯·诺依曼代数（W*-代数）</td>\n<td>为无限维算子的取极限封闭性建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遍历理论</td>\n<td>平均遍历定理</td>\n<td>证明&quot;时间平均等于空间平均&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测度与几何</td>\n<td>测度论、量子逻辑等若干奠基工作</td>\n<td>为后续分支提供基础语言</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>翻译即求解</strong>：把博弈译成不动点问题、把量子力学译成希尔伯特空间算子、把遍历假说译成投影算子收敛。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式</strong>：不宜把他读成&quot;无所不能&quot;——他提供的是可迁移的武器库与转译能力，后续深耕多由他人完成。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数学基础-序数的现代定义\">数学基础：序数的现代定义</h2><p>少年成名的冯·诺依曼，最早的重要贡献落在数学基础与公理化集合论。1923 年（年仅约 20 岁）他给出了<strong>序数的现代定义</strong>：把每个序数定义为&quot;所有比它小的序数构成的集合&quot;，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0=\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1=\\{0\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2=\\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=\\{0,1,\\dots,n-1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = \\{\\beta : \\beta &lt; \\alpha\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个看似简单的定义影响极大：它让序数成为可以直接用集合操作的对象，是今天每一本集合论教材的标准起点。此外他参与发展了<strong>冯·诺依曼–贝尔奈斯–哥德尔集合论（NBG）</strong>，这是与 ZFC 等价但允许&quot;真类&quot;的公理体系，在范畴论等需要谈论&quot;所有集合的集合&quot;的场合更顺手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算子理论-冯-诺依曼代数\">算子理论：冯·诺依曼代数</h2><p>冯·诺依曼最深刻的纯数学遗产，是为无限维空间上的算子建立了系统理论。他严格化了<strong>希尔伯特空间</strong>（无穷维的、带内积的完备向量空间）上有界算子的研究，并在 1930 年代与默里（Francis Murray）合作开创了后来以他命名的<strong>冯·诺依曼代数</strong>（即 W*-代数）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>朴素含义</th>\n<th>为何重要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>希尔伯特空间</td>\n<td>无穷维的&quot;带几何的向量空间&quot;</td>\n<td>量子态、信号、函数都活在其中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界算子</td>\n<td>空间上&quot;温和&quot;的线性变换</td>\n<td>对应可观测量、演化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冯·诺依曼代数</td>\n<td>对取极限封闭的算子代数</td>\n<td>量子场论、统计力学的数学语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因子分类（I/II/III 型）</td>\n<td>代数的&quot;不可再分&quot;基本块</td>\n<td>揭示连续维数等深刻现象</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中最反直觉的发现是<strong>II₁ 型因子</strong>：存在一种代数，其&quot;维数&quot;可以连续取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 区间内任意实数，而非只能是整数——这彻底超出了有限维线性代数的直觉，至今是算子代数研究的核心对象。这套理论不是纯抽象游戏：它直接成为量子力学严格化的数学骨架（见姊妹篇），后来还通向了量子场论与统计力学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"遍历理论-平均时间等于平均空间\">遍历理论：平均时间等于平均空间</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;一个粒子&lt;br/&gt;沿轨迹长期运动&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;时间平均&quot;| C[&quot;长期停留各处的平均&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;整个相空间&lt;br/&gt;所有可能状态&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;空间平均&quot;| C&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;遍历定理:&lt;br/&gt;两者相等&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"一个粒子&lt;br/&gt;沿轨迹长期运动\"] --&gt;|\"时间平均\"| C[\"长期停留各处的平均\"]\n    B[\"整个相空间&lt;br/&gt;所有可能状态\"] --&gt;|\"空间平均\"| C\n    C --&gt; D[\"遍历定理:&lt;br/&gt;两者相等\"]</pre><p>1932 年，冯·诺依曼证明了<strong>平均遍历定理</strong>（mean ergodic theorem），用希尔伯特空间的算子语言严格表述并证明了物理学家长期假设而未证的&quot;遍历假说&quot;：一个系统沿单条轨迹的长期时间平均，等于它在整个相空间上的空间平均。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msup><mi>U</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1} U^n f = Pf</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">lim</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 是保测变换诱导的算子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是到不变子空间的投影。）这条定理给统计力学奠了数学基础。一段值得记下的学术史插曲：伯克霍夫（George Birkhoff）几乎同时证明了更强的<strong>逐点遍历定理</strong>，并抢先发表，引出过优先权的小争论——这再次提醒，重大突破常是数人同时逼近的结果，而非孤胆英雄的独奏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一种独特的工作方式\">一种独特的工作方式</h2><p>把这些散落各领域的成果放在一起看，会浮现出冯·诺依曼的一个鲜明特征：他擅长<strong>把一个领域的问题翻译成另一个领域已有强大工具的语言</strong>。把博弈&quot;翻译&quot;成不动点问题、把量子力学&quot;翻译&quot;成希尔伯特空间算子、把遍历假说&quot;翻译&quot;成投影算子的收敛——这种&quot;换语言以求解&quot;的思维，正是他能横跨众多领域的方法论内核，详见兄弟 hub<a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/\">《思想与方法》</a>。</p>\n<p>需要避免的一个反模式叙事是&quot;他什么都懂、无所不能&quot;。更准确的说法是：他拥有一套可迁移的数学武器库和惊人的转译能力，使他能在新领域迅速做出第一流而非全部的贡献——例如博弈论后续的纳什均衡、算子代数后续的 Connes 分类，都由他人推进。承认这一点，才能看清他贡献的真实形状。</p>\n<h2 id=\"它在本卷中的位置\">它在本卷中的位置</h2><p>本篇与<a href=\"quantum-mechanics-and-beyond\">《量子力学及其他》</a>共同构成&quot;旷世全才&quot;一章：本篇是纯数学根基，姊妹篇是向物理与生命科学的延伸。他这些数学工作如何被后世各学科继承，见兄弟 hub<a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields/\">《影响与遗产·跨领域影响》</a>；具体著作（如《量子力学的数学基础》）见<a href=\"../../major-works/\">《代表作品》</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冯·诺依曼首先是纯数学家，在数学基础、算子理论、遍历理论、测度论与几何学等领域都留下了以他命名的成果。</li>\n<li>他给出序数的现代定义并参与发展 NBG 集合论，成为今天集合论教材的标准起点。</li>\n<li>他与默里开创的冯·诺依曼代数及其因子分类（尤其 II₁ 型因子）是算子代数至今的核心研究对象。</li>\n<li>1932 年的平均遍历定理以算子语言证明了&quot;时间平均等于空间平均&quot;，为统计力学奠定数学基础。</li>\n<li>这些工作共享一种方法论内核：把陌生领域的问题翻译成已有强大工具的语言，从而迅速抵达核心。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_von_Neumann\">John von Neumann — Wikipedia</a>；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Von_Neumann_algebra\">Von Neumann algebra — Wikipedia</a>；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ergodic_theory\">Mean ergodic theorem — Wikipedia</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"对数学的贡献","id":"对数学的贡献"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数学基础：序数的现代定义","id":"数学基础-序数的现代定义"},{"level":2,"text":"算子理论：冯·诺依曼代数","id":"算子理论-冯-诺依曼代数"},{"level":2,"text":"遍历理论：平均时间等于平均空间","id":"遍历理论-平均时间等于平均空间"},{"level":2,"text":"一种独特的工作方式","id":"一种独特的工作方式"},{"level":2,"text":"它在本卷中的位置","id":"它在本卷中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博弈论与经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/founding-game-theory/game-theory-and-economics"},"next":{"title":"量子力学及其他","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/a-universal-genius/quantum-mechanics-and-beyond"}}